  "body": "Follow-up of #2282.\n\nThe app now reads the shipped post scripts from `assets/posts` on disk at run time. A user can edit such a file, and the edit changes the posted G-code.\n\nNow the app writes the full path of each shipped file to the log one time (`read shipped posts file <path>`). The post dialog does not show the path.\n\nDone means:\n- The post dialog shows the full path of the post script that makes the program (`posting::builtin_post_path` gives it for a shipped post).\n- A structural UI test pins the label.\n- The program header does not change, so the goldens do not change.\n",
